==Related unique items==
The following [[unique items]] have special modifiers that involve accuracy:

===x% increased/reduced Accuracy Rating===

{{Drop enabled unique item table
|tables=item_stats
|join=items._pageID=item_stats._pageID
|where=item_stats.id="accuracy_rating_+%"
|large=1
|stat=1
|level=1
}}

===+x Accuracy Rating===

{{Drop enabled unique item table
|tables=item_stats
|join=items._pageID=item_stats._pageID
|where=item_stats.id="accuracy_rating"
|large=1
|stat=1
|level=1
|stat_column1_header=Accuracy
|stat_column1_stat_format=add
|stat_column1_stat1_id=accuracy_rating
}}

===Unique accuracy stats===

{{Drop enabled unique item table
|tables=item_stats
|join=items._pageID=item_stats._pageID
|where=
    (item_stats.id LIKE "%accuracy%"
    AND item_stats.id != "local_accuracy_rating_+%"
    AND item_stats.id != "local_accuracy_rating"
    AND item_stats.id != "accuracy_rating_+%"
    AND item_stats.id != "accuracy_rating")
    OR item_stats.id LIKE "%always_hit%"
    OR items.name = "Bound Fate"
|large=1
|stat=1
|level=1
}}

